.md
## New event listeners for `Graphics`
We added new events to track:
- `"metaclick"` - fired when you click with <kbd>Ctrl/Cmd</kbd> pressed
- `"shiftclick"` - fired when you click with <kbd>Shift</kbd> pressed
- `"capturekeyevents"` - fires for both: pressed and released keys

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## New event listeners for `Graphics`
We added new events to track:
- `"metaclick"` - fired when you click with <kbd >Ctrl/Cmd</kbd> pressed
- `"shiftclick"` - fired when you click with <kbd >Shift</kbd> pressed
- `"capturekeyevents"` - fires for both: pressed and released keys

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
EventHandler[Plot[x, {x,0,1}], {
  "metaclick" -> (Print[StringTemplate["Meta as ``"][#]]&),
  "shiftclick" -> (Print[StringTemplate["Shift as ``"][#]]&)
}]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
and here is an example for key capture

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
and here is an example for key capture

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
EventHandler[Graphics[{
  Disk[], StandardRed, Text["Focus on me", {0,0}, {0,0}]
}, ImageSize->200], {
  "capturekeyevents" -> (Print[StringTemplate["``"][#]]&)
}]

